# Tik-Talk

- Match Figma pixel-for-pixel. Do not invent layouts, colors, or copy. Read Figma via MCP (`get_design_context` + screenshot) before coding a screen.
- Angular 22, standalone only, no NgModules. Scaffold with `ng generate`.
- Use signals (`signal`, `computed`, `input()`, `output()`). New forms: Signal Forms.
- Structure: `src/app/pages/` (routes), `src/app/common-ui/` (shared UI), `src/app/data-access/` (HTTP, models, interceptors).
- Style with SCSS and CSS variables in `src/styles.scss`. No Tailwind.
- HTTP via `provideHttpClient` + interceptors. Auth token on API calls except login.
- Asset paths must not contain spaces. Prefer `public/assets/imgs/`.
- After UI changes, verify the screen in the browser. After code generation, run `ng build`.
